---
import GenericSection from "../components/GenericSection.astro";
import SectionSubtitle from "../components/SectionSubtitle.astro";
import SectionTitle from "../components/SectionTitle.astro";

import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
---

<GenericSection name="Get Involved">

    <SectionTitle name="Get Involved" />
    <p>
        Sussex County Maker Fest can't happen without our exhibitors,
        volunteers, and sponsors.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row">
        <div class="card bg-base-200 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h3 class="card-title">Exhibitors</h3>
                <p>
                    We'd love for you or your organization to become a part of
                    Sussex County Maker Fest. Agricultural speakers, crafters
                    and makers, and STEM clubs are encouraged to participate. At
                    Sussex County Maker Festival, we encourage new and different
                    participants to join us. If you don't see your field
                    mentioned in past events, fill out our Call for Exhibitors
                    form and be the first!
                </p>
                <p>
                    Registration is free for exhibitors and educators, but there
                    is a $50/day fee for vendors. If you're interested in both
                    vending and exhibiting, please <a
                        href="mailto:Ideal.Farms.Makers@protonmail.com"
                        >reach out</a
                    > to discuss possible discounts or waivers.
                </p>
                <div class="card-actions justify-end">
                    <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary text-primary-content"
                        >Exhibit or vend at SCMF</a
                    >
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col">
            <div class="card bg-base-200 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title">Sponsors</h3>
                    <p>
                        We deeply appreciate our sponsors for helping us make
                        this event free for everyone to attend.
                    </p>
                    <div class="card-actions justify-end">
                        <a href="#our-partners" class="btn btn-primary"
                            >Our Partners</a
                        >
                        <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Become a Sponsor</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="card bg-base-200 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title">Volunteers</h3>
                    <p>
                        If you want to help make SCMF happen, we'd love your
                        help as a volunteer. While entry is free for everyone,
                        we pride ourselves on having wonderful food for our
                        volunteers. We welcome volunteers for the entire event
                        or whatever portion you're available for.
                    </p>
                    <div class="card-actions justify-end">
                        <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary text-primary-content"
                            >Sign up to volunteer</a
                        >
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</GenericSection>
